# Only what the app needs goes into the image, named one by one. Everything else stays out,
# above all .local/ (personal data), keys and local notes such as AGENTS.override.md. deploy/
# and compose.yaml come along so the EC2 host takes its files from the release it installs.
*
!*.py
!web/
!examples/
!deploy/
!compose.yaml
!starter_boards.json
!requirements.txt
